WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:45.963
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

2
00:00:57.975 --> 00:00:59.768
Wait until it's done

3
00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:02.229
You sprinkle some sand on it like this

4
00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.939
(Former safety management team leader of ACT Asan Factory)

5
00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:06.066
Wait until it clumps

6
00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:08.944
Start sweeping again

7
00:01:09.528 --> 00:01:11.655
{\an8}(First day of work at ACT Asan Factory)

8
00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.198
{\an8}Just pour it out like this

9
00:01:14.116 --> 00:01:15.200
- What?
- Very simple, right?

10
00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:17.452
Dog food is here

11
00:01:17.536 --> 00:01:19.621
As for water, just use water from the faucet.

12
00:01:19.705 --> 00:01:21.665
I heard that tap water contains minerals and is better if you drink it.

13
00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:24.418
- But...
- Feces stinks when piled together

14
00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.878
So clean it up in time

15
00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:28.338
Why should I...

16
00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.424
After six o'clock in the evening, security will take over.

17
00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.926
but during working hours

18
00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:34.595
Don't forget this is our job

19
00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:36.096
No

20
00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:39.516
Why do the safety and health managers do this?

21
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.476
If you step on feces, you may slip and fall.

22
00:01:42.144 --> 00:01:44.396
Slips and falls can be dangerous. This is a matter of safety.

23
00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:47.357
If the excrement is not cleaned up, it will emit a peculiar smell.

24
00:01:47.858 --> 00:01:50.193
Odor will attract mosquitoes, which is related to hygiene

25
00:01:50.861 --> 00:01:53.238
Isn’t safety and health your responsibility?

26
00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:55.032
OK I understand

27
00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.743
That’s pretty much the handover work.

28
00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:59.703
- What?
- Do you smoke?

29
00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.705
You just showed me how to unclog the toilet

30
00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.291
How to clean up dog poop

31
00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:05.250
Is this the end?

32
00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.335
follow me

33
00:02:07.586 --> 00:02:08.795
This way

34
00:02:17.304 --> 00:02:19.681
{\an8}Listen carefully

35
00:02:19.765 --> 00:02:21.391
{\an8}I will only explain it once

36
00:02:24.436 --> 00:02:28.023
{\an8}Tuesday, May 20

37
00:02:28.607 --> 00:02:29.524
{\an8}(Safety Checklist)

38
00:02:29.608 --> 00:02:32.027
{\an8}Draw circles here, here and here

39
00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:35.947
{\an8}Occasionally draw a triangle or two

40
00:02:36.031 --> 00:02:39.284
{\an8}Then draw a circle

41
00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:43.163
{\an8}At the end of the month, take pictures of them all

42
00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:44.456
{\an8}Made into PDF

43
00:02:44.539 --> 00:02:46.625
{\an8}- PDF
- Send to headquarters

44
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:47.834
{\an8}-Okay
- However

45
00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:50.253
{\an8}No one will read it at all

46
00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:55.342
One more thing, 12 noon
Logistics trucks will depart from here

47
00:02:55.425 --> 00:02:56.426
OK

48
00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:59.513
You have to check whether the goods are packed
To avoid falling off on the road

49
00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:01.139
It should be installed

50
00:03:01.223 --> 00:03:04.101
But you still have to be like this
Pull the strap a few times to confirm.

51
00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.228
If installed very securely

52
00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:09.523
Just sign the form given by the logistics team employee.

53
00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:13.777
In addition, we should do safety exercises collectively before going to work.

54
00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:17.614
You have to stand in front of everyone and set an example

55
00:03:19.074 --> 00:03:20.826
- Me?
- that's you

56
00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:24.705
It’s very difficult for introverts to do this.
Me too before

57
00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:27.499
That's probably all I have to explain.

58
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:29.751
Do you smoke or not?

59
00:03:31.253 --> 00:03:34.464
But this is a factory with hundreds of people after all.

60
00:03:34.548 --> 00:03:36.633
Isn't it necessary
A decent safety management system?

61
00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:40.345
Do you have any qualifications in industrial safety?

62
00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:42.097
- No
- Isn’t that the right thing to do?

63
00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:44.474
we are all the same

64
00:03:44.558 --> 00:03:45.934
If you don’t know how to do it, how can you manage it?

65
00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:50.564
If you don't smoke, I'll go say goodbye to the dog.

66
00:03:50.647 --> 00:03:53.233
Find a place to lie down until you get off work

67
00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:54.317
You should be busy first

68
00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:56.737
Oops, I almost forgot

69
00:03:57.738 --> 00:03:58.905
give

70
00:04:00.574 --> 00:04:02.784
If you have a team dinner, give me a call

71
00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:03.952
(ACT Fried Chicken Grand Opening)

72
00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:06.538
There is no other restaurant nearby that can handle an order for 120 people.

73
00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:08.290
I will also give away a lot of free gifts. How about that?

74
00:04:08.832 --> 00:04:12.294
If you are interested
You can even inquire about joining

75
00:04:12.794 --> 00:04:15.088
Then I'm leaving. Good luck to you.

76
00:04:17.299 --> 00:04:20.135
Sooner or later, reality will hit you hard.

77
00:04:21.344 --> 00:04:23.555
Call me then

78
00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:25.432
See you later

79
00:04:26.391 --> 00:04:29.227
Hello, I opened a fried chicken restaurant

80
00:04:30.353 --> 00:04:32.689
Lots of gifts for you

81
00:04:32.773 --> 00:04:34.024
Come if you have time

82
00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:43.825
Attention all staff
Thank you all for your hard work this morning

83
00:04:45.035 --> 00:04:47.537
It’s lunch time from now till 1pm

84
00:04:48.914 --> 00:04:52.000
Wish you all a happy meal

85
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:54.544
(Note: This door is broken and is strictly prohibited to be opened)

86
00:05:01.384 --> 00:05:03.428
It’s time to eat!

87
00:05:28.578 --> 00:05:32.249
They ran away in a swarm
Just to have an early meal?

88
00:05:32.916 --> 00:05:35.210
It's so uncivilized. It's too barbaric.

89
00:05:35.293 --> 00:05:37.045
- Sorry
- scared me

90
00:05:37.128 --> 00:05:39.548
Are you the new leader of the security management team?

91
00:05:39.631 --> 00:05:40.549
yes

92
00:05:42.217 --> 00:05:43.552
follow me

93
00:05:44.302 --> 00:05:45.428
By the way, about the truck

94
00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:50.016
It seems pretty stable

95
00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.101
Please sign here

96
00:05:52.435 --> 00:05:53.562
Good

97
00:05:57.774 --> 00:05:58.775
Let’s go!

98
00:05:59.484 --> 00:06:00.485
Aren't you going to eat?

99
00:06:03.864 --> 00:06:05.615
Why does everyone love running so much?

100
00:06:09.327 --> 00:06:13.790
(ACT Asan Factory)

101
00:06:17.419 --> 00:06:19.337
(People are iron, rice is steel, work safely without panic)

102
00:06:21.298 --> 00:06:22.299
(Pick up meals on demand to avoid waste)

103
00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:30.557
Oops, I forgot to say that

104
00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:33.852
You must run to the canteen for lunch

105
00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:37.022
Otherwise, I won’t even be able to drink the soup.

106
00:06:41.276 --> 00:06:42.777
This team is lined up...

107
00:07:00.879 --> 00:07:01.880
Isn't it?

108
00:07:01.963 --> 00:07:03.298
Sorry

109
00:07:04.966 --> 00:07:06.217
Sorry

110
00:07:06.301 --> 00:07:07.302
What's wrong?

111
00:07:07.385 --> 00:07:08.637
The seaweed soup is gone

112
00:07:11.222 --> 00:07:12.849
We don't have any anymore

113
00:07:13.975 --> 00:07:15.226
hello aunt

114
00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:16.686
Come in quickly

115
00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:17.979
take it

116
00:07:18.063 --> 00:07:19.314
thank you

117
00:07:19.397 --> 00:07:21.149
- Thank you for your hard work
- You too, auntie

118
00:07:22.359 --> 00:07:23.568
What are you doing? Didn’t you say it’s gone?

119
00:07:23.652 --> 00:07:25.403
sorry

120
00:07:26.237 --> 00:07:27.155
Really

121
00:07:32.535 --> 00:07:33.536
Ouch

122
00:07:34.829 --> 00:07:36.289
come on

123
00:07:43.213 --> 00:07:47.801
Attention all staff. Are you satisfied with your lunch?

124
00:07:48.885 --> 00:07:52.013
Afternoon class is about to start

125
00:07:53.223 --> 00:07:57.018
Please return to your work station and be ready to work.

126
00:08:07.278 --> 00:08:10.198
Episode 5: Rice Bowl

127
00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.763
Where are the underwear? Do you want me to send some more?

128
00:08:33.847 --> 00:08:34.806
(underwear)

129
00:08:34.889 --> 00:08:37.017
No, that's enough

130
00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.436
Where are the socks? Do you want more?

131
00:08:40.145 --> 00:08:42.147
Socks are enough

132
00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:45.900
I go home every weekend. Don't worry.

133
00:08:46.943 --> 00:08:48.820
There are washing machines and dryers here

134
00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:50.196
Do you think this is a prison?

135
00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:53.408
Come on, can you use a washing machine?

136
00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:57.245
Please, I'm the director of an IT company

137
00:08:59.414 --> 00:09:01.958
What does this have to do with IT?

138
00:09:04.252 --> 00:09:05.420
How is it?

139
00:09:05.503 --> 00:09:07.255
Are the people there easy to get along with?

140
00:09:08.965 --> 00:09:12.510
It doesn’t matter whether he gets along well or not
Anyway, I can't stay here for long.

141
00:09:16.097 --> 00:09:17.223
Seriously

142
00:09:17.307 --> 00:09:21.019
Are you sure you can still go back to the headquarters?

143
00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:23.646
How many times do I have to say the same thing?

144
00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.356
I'm just here to stay for a while.

145
00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:27.901
I'll save some experience and go back to raise the tube.

146
00:09:27.984 --> 00:09:29.569
Stop talking about these useless things. I'm dead.

147
00:09:29.652 --> 00:09:31.529
Okay, I won’t say anything anymore

148
00:09:31.613 --> 00:09:33.573
I'll make some more side dishes for you next week

149
00:09:33.656 --> 00:09:36.576
Sorry, I'm really busy this week

150
00:09:37.285 --> 00:09:39.954
You have to eat well, you know?

151
00:09:40.497 --> 00:09:41.873
Got it

152
00:09:42.499 --> 00:09:43.416
Soo Kyum...

153
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.918
(End of call Ha Zhen)

154
00:09:48.838 --> 00:09:50.673
Why is she so nice to me?

155
00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:58.306
How could you do this to me?

156
00:09:58.973 --> 00:10:01.434
What did I do wrong?

157
00:10:14.656 --> 00:10:16.157
keep working

158
00:10:19.035 --> 00:10:20.578
No need to send it to me

159
00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:22.205
No, it's okay

160
00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:38.596
{\an8}(Bai Zhengtai)

161
00:10:51.484 --> 00:10:54.779
(Beyond telecommunications, connect you and me)

162
00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:09.812
(I heard you were transferred to the factory
I bought you a practical bag)

163
00:12:09.938 --> 00:12:11.814
(I will contact you often
Thank you for everything Soo Gyom)

164
00:12:30.875 --> 00:12:33.002
Husband gives

165
00:12:33.086 --> 00:12:35.171
These are eaten in the car

166
00:12:35.255 --> 00:12:37.590
I also packed a few things you like to eat at night

167
00:12:37.674 --> 00:12:39.801
The rest arrive at the dormitory

168
00:12:39.884 --> 00:12:41.594
You have to put it in the refrigerator right away, remember?

169
00:12:42.262 --> 00:12:44.264
Remember, why did you prepare so many things?

170
00:12:44.347 --> 00:12:46.099
- Go back to sleep. It's okay.
- OK

171
00:12:46.182 --> 00:12:48.101
There are too many things. Let me send you down.

172
00:12:48.184 --> 00:12:50.937
Don't worry it's okay

173
00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.481
No need to send it to me

174
00:13:01.531 --> 00:13:02.532
Go in

175
00:13:53.374 --> 00:13:55.251
- (Zero accident again today!
- ACT safety exercises)

176
00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:56.878
Really terrible

177
00:13:57.670 --> 00:13:58.796
How to do this?

178
00:13:59.797 --> 00:14:00.673
two, three

179
00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:40.671
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight

180
00:14:40.755 --> 00:14:43.674
two, two, three, four

181
00:14:43.758 --> 00:14:46.386
five, six, seven, eight

182
00:14:46.469 --> 00:14:49.472
One, two, three, four

183
00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:52.308
five, six, seven, eight

184
00:14:52.392 --> 00:14:54.852
two, two, three, four

185
00:14:54.936 --> 00:14:56.896
five, six, seven, eight

186
00:14:56.979 --> 00:14:58.314
{\an8}(Follow the process and strictly abide by the rules)

187
00:14:58.398 --> 00:15:00.108
One, two, three, four

188
00:15:00.733 --> 00:15:03.361
five, six, seven, eight

189
00:15:03.444 --> 00:15:06.155
two, two, three, four

190
00:15:06.239 --> 00:15:08.783
five, six, seven, eight

191
00:15:08.866 --> 00:15:11.494
One, two, three, four

192
00:15:11.577 --> 00:15:12.537
Safety slogan Get ready!

193
00:15:13.955 --> 00:15:15.289
Safety slogan Start!

194
00:15:15.373 --> 00:15:18.167
Safety helmet confirmed! Workwear confirmed!

195
00:15:18.251 --> 00:15:20.002
Safety shoes confirmed!

196
00:15:20.086 --> 00:15:21.587
- Safety first!
- Safety first!

197
00:15:22.964 --> 00:15:24.465
Instead of setting limits on yourself...

198
00:15:24.549 --> 00:15:26.676
- It’s better to challenge firmly!
- It’s better to challenge firmly!

199
00:16:05.756 --> 00:16:07.216
(Security Management Group)

200
00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.343
(reception desk payment desk)

201
00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:13.639
February 30th? No?

202
00:16:13.723 --> 00:16:14.599
(Safety Checklist)

203
00:16:14.682 --> 00:16:17.059
God, could they have been more perfunctory?

204
00:16:17.143 --> 00:16:18.478
(2024 ACT Safety Checklist)

205
00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:22.857
Really terrible

206
00:16:23.566 --> 00:16:26.694
What on earth am I doing here?

207
00:16:31.324 --> 00:16:34.410
Do you really want to consider joining Sang Cheol’s company?

208
00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:38.998
It's really nerve-wracking

209
00:16:45.671 --> 00:16:47.798
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

210
00:16:50.676 --> 00:16:52.220
It took two whole days and I finally got back.

211
00:16:52.303 --> 00:16:53.638
(I will contact you often. Take care)

212
00:16:53.721 --> 00:16:55.014
OK Good luck

213
00:16:56.516 --> 00:16:59.519
Executive Bai, I respect your stupid decision.

214
00:16:59.602 --> 00:17:03.022
But you said it yourself
We all have to be responsible for our own choices.

215
00:17:03.105 --> 00:17:04.690
Then let's see how responsible you are

216
00:17:04.774 --> 00:17:07.401
Because of losing Kim Nak-soo
And the shaky ACT sales team!

217
00:17:07.485 --> 00:17:09.111
(ACT Building 1, ACT Building 2)

218
00:17:09.195 --> 00:17:10.863
No, that's not... Oh my god, wait a minute.

219
00:17:10.947 --> 00:17:13.533
Director, not section chief, it’s Kukkiwon

220
00:17:13.616 --> 00:17:15.576
Their live broadcast was so stuck that it turned into a mess.

221
00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:16.953
What should we do?

222
00:17:17.036 --> 00:17:19.205
Minister Kim is the best at dealing with this kind of problem.

223
00:17:19.288 --> 00:17:20.248
Do you want to call him?

224
00:17:20.331 --> 00:17:23.668
What nonsense are you talking about? Give it to me

225
00:17:24.585 --> 00:17:25.461
give

226
00:17:25.545 --> 00:17:27.755
I am Director Du Zhenyu of the ACT sales team

227
00:17:28.297 --> 00:17:29.757
Internet speed too slow?

228
00:17:30.258 --> 00:17:33.553
Turn off the modem and restart it

229
00:17:35.555 --> 00:17:36.806
Useless? Then...

230
00:17:36.889 --> 00:17:39.642
Unplug the cord and plug it in again

231
00:17:40.393 --> 00:17:41.602
Still useless?

232
00:17:41.686 --> 00:17:42.562
- Impossible
- Then

233
00:17:42.645 --> 00:17:44.689
Unplug the power cord and plug it in again

234
00:17:46.482 --> 00:17:49.443
How about you pat the machine and pat it hard... Hello?

235
00:17:49.527 --> 00:17:51.362
But one person left

236
00:17:51.445 --> 00:17:54.031
A whole year of hard work was destroyed in three days!

237
00:17:54.115 --> 00:17:55.449
You keep saying you are capable!

238
00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:57.785
I just handed over a group to you!

239
00:17:58.536 --> 00:17:59.954
If you can’t do it, stop bragging!

240
00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:01.539
(Sales performance analysis)

241
00:18:02.707 --> 00:18:04.792
Okay, you go out first

242
00:18:08.879 --> 00:18:10.381
And you boy!

243
00:18:10.464 --> 00:18:13.509
How dare you drag your slippers into the executive office!

244
00:18:14.343 --> 00:18:15.511
Do you think I'm easy to bully?

245
00:18:16.012 --> 00:18:17.513
- Right...
- Get out!

246
00:18:21.017 --> 00:18:22.310
I'm so angry!

247
00:18:34.739 --> 00:18:36.115
Luo Zhu, is that you?

248
00:18:37.408 --> 00:18:38.909
Brother, it’s brother

249
00:18:39.744 --> 00:18:42.955
I'm really sorry for you, it's just...

250
00:18:43.706 --> 00:18:48.169
It seems you have to come back.

251
00:18:49.545 --> 00:18:52.465
Once you leave, everything will be messed up.

252
00:18:56.052 --> 00:18:59.847
Okay, you're just asking for humiliation.

253
00:19:03.601 --> 00:19:04.852
Attention all staff

254
00:19:05.394 --> 00:19:08.314
Thank you all for your hard work this morning

255
00:19:10.232 --> 00:19:13.444
- Lunch time starts now until 1pm
-Sleep so comfortable

256
00:19:14.236 --> 00:19:17.156
Wish you all a happy meal

257
00:19:17.239 --> 00:19:19.533
I have to keep having this dream

258
00:19:20.201 --> 00:19:22.203
It’s time to eat!

259
00:19:30.002 --> 00:19:31.170
Really

260
00:19:31.671 --> 00:19:33.255
Why did you come?

261
00:19:33.339 --> 00:19:35.174
Hurry!

262
00:19:37.426 --> 00:19:38.344
sign here

263
00:19:42.223 --> 00:19:44.892
It’s too late to set off!

264
00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:18.300
(Strawberry yogurt)

265
00:20:24.724 --> 00:20:26.100
Each person can only take one box

266
00:20:26.684 --> 00:20:27.560
What?

267
00:20:28.269 --> 00:20:30.020
