Have you checked it out?

805
00:56:46.904 --> 00:56:48.196
Found it, Minister

806
00:56:48.280 --> 00:56:50.115
I asked the human resources staff at the same time.

807
00:56:50.198 --> 00:56:52.534
As you said, there is indeed such a person

808
00:56:52.618 --> 00:56:55.162
Transferred back to the headquarters from the factory

809
00:56:56.622 --> 00:56:58.999
He is Special Agent Shen Kangxun

810
00:56:59.082 --> 00:57:01.251
Same situation as you, Minister, in 2008

811
00:57:01.335 --> 00:57:03.545
He was transferred to the ACT Technical Security Management Group

812
00:57:03.629 --> 00:57:06.840
Later, when I returned to the headquarters, I was promoted to the position of Special Agent

813
00:57:11.637 --> 00:57:15.349
I finally got his contact information

814
00:57:15.432 --> 00:57:16.934
This will be sent to you

815
00:57:18.018 --> 00:57:20.562
But how did you know this person?

816
00:57:20.646 --> 00:57:23.482
(Instead of setting limits on yourself, challenge yourself resolutely)

817
00:57:42.209 --> 00:57:43.377
What?

818
00:57:52.010 --> 00:57:53.053
What's going on?

819
00:58:06.233 --> 00:58:08.068
Go around. You can't go here.

820
00:58:24.209 --> 00:58:25.210
(December 16, 2008)

821
00:58:25.293 --> 00:58:26.753
After suffering in this hell for 182 days

822
00:58:26.837 --> 00:58:31.091
I'm finally going back to headquarters

823
00:58:31.925 --> 00:58:34.761
don't give up hope

824
00:58:35.345 --> 00:58:38.056
now it's your turn

825
00:58:44.396 --> 00:58:46.148
I don’t run to fight for food

826
00:58:47.315 --> 00:58:49.234
It’s not just to win over this little girl.

827
00:58:50.152 --> 00:58:52.863
I run to prove that this punishment is wrong

828
00:58:52.946 --> 00:58:54.031
It’s for me, Kim Nak-soo

829
00:58:54.114 --> 00:58:56.700
As Minister Kim of ACT Group
Return in an upright manner

830
00:58:57.617 --> 00:58:59.619
This is the meaning of my running

831
00:58:59.703 --> 00:59:00.662
(canteen)

832
00:59:22.851 --> 00:59:23.852
Enjoy your meal

833
00:59:27.189 --> 00:59:30.150
And since you like that dog so much

834
00:59:30.233 --> 00:59:31.610
It's up to you to wash the water bowl.

835
00:59:35.906 --> 00:59:38.450
I must go back at any cost

836
00:59:41.828 --> 00:59:48.794
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

837
01:00:29.960 --> 01:00:32.087
You guy... come back!

838
01:01:28.351 --> 01:01:30.937
{\an8}Transfer Kim Nak-soo back to the headquarters, senior

839
01:01:31.938 --> 01:01:34.399
{\an8}People I can turn to

840
01:01:35.317 --> 01:01:36.443
{\an8}The only one left is you, senior

841
01:01:37.611 --> 01:01:39.029
{\an8}- Chengjiu!
- Minister!

842
01:01:39.112 --> 01:01:40.614
{\an8}But you still have to take good care of him.

843
01:01:40.697 --> 01:01:42.532
{\an8}I might have to work under him someday.

844
01:01:42.616 --> 01:01:45.368
{\an8}The bad guy Kim Nak-soo would like to say hello to you.

845
01:01:46.411 --> 01:01:49.456
{\an8}You are on the sales team anyway
There's no one else to rely on

846
01:01:49.539 --> 01:01:50.999
{\an8}At this time

847
01:01:51.082 --> 01:01:53.460
{\an8}You need to show more loyalty
Otherwise, how could there be a turnaround?

848
01:01:53.543 --> 01:01:56.254
{\an8}Human Resources Group
The biggest battlefield this year is the Asan factory

849
01:01:56.338 --> 01:01:57.380
{\an8}Senior

850
01:01:57.464 --> 01:01:59.591
{\an8}We need your help

851
01:02:00.342 --> 01:02:01.718
{\an8}Ha Jin, I’m sorry.

852
01:02:02.302 --> 01:02:03.595
{\an8}I got into big trouble

853
01:02:03.678 --> 01:02:05.680
{\an8}Subtitle translation: Jia Xue

